Cell["\<\
\\frac{\\text{mST}^4 \\left(-x_t+x-1\\right) \\left(2 \\left(x
   \\left(\\frac{\\text{mChi}^2}{\\text{mST}^2}-2\\right)+\\left(x_t-1\\right)\
{}^2\\right) \\log
   \\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{\\lambda }-x_t+x+1}{2 \
\\sqrt{x}}\\right)+\\sqrt{\\lambda } \\left(2 x_t-\\left(x_t+x-1\\right)
   \\log (x)\\right)\\right)}{128 \\pi ^4 \\sqrt{\\lambda } \\text{MT}^4}\
\>", "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{
